ltation  documents are available at  www.stratford.gov dot uk  slash sappo that's w www.stratford.com  s-a-p-p-o if you have any queries about  the conversation then please do email  planning dot policy stratfor hyphen  dc.gov dot uk  that's planning dot policy at stratford  hyphen vc.com  so the fundamental purpose of the site  allocations plan is to proactively set  out how we will continue to meet  the development challenges that our  district faces  if you disagree with our approach then  please do suggest what you think a  better alternative  is but these questions will still exist  even if we don't prepare a plan and your  comments are most helpful when framed in  this context  so please do fill out an interactive  form or send your comments to  policy dot consultation at stratford  hyphen dc dot dot dot uk  that's policy dot consultation at  stratford hyphen dc.gov dot  conservation closes at 5 pm on friday  the 18th of december  thanks very much for your time
 

